        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock\n- Products: “Money Trees”, Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, Section.80, “Worst Behavior”\n- Roles: American hip hop recording artist, American rapper, Canadian rapper, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album Section.80 in 2011 as an independent album exclusively through the iTunes Store.\n- In 2012, Kendrick Lamar released Good Kid, M.A.A.D City as his second studio album.\n- “Money Trees” is a song by American hip hop recording artist Kendrick Lamar from his major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.\n- Producer Dahi is known for producing Drake’s “Worst Behavior” and Kendrick Lamar’s “Money Trees.”\n- “Money Trees” features Kendrick Lamar’s label-mate Jay Rock.",
